===Notes===
*The range bonus applies to every talent that counts as a spell or a mind power, not only psionic ones. For example, most wild gifts and [[Rune|runes]] also benefit.
*The maximum of 10 also applies to talents whose range is already above 10, so their range is lowered to 10 while the device is active:
**{{t|Precognition}}: if it is cast while the device is active, its sensing radius of 12 or more is reduced to 10.
**{{t|Judgement}} and {{t|Searing Sight}}: their range is taken from the radius of {{t|Radiance}}, which can exceed 10 if its effective talent level is above 5.
**{{t|Thread Walk}}: when used with a bow, its range is the bow's range, which can exceed 10 with enough range bonuses.

